 "n": 2,
 "title": "The defense's 11: base, nickel and dime",
 "html": "<p><strong>Three layers, front to back:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Defensive linemen (DL):</strong> line up nose-to-nose with the offensive line. Rush the QB or plug running lanes.</li>\n<li><strong>Linebackers (LB):</strong> stand 4–5 yards behind them. Tackle runners, cover backs and tight ends, sometimes rush the QB.</li>\n<li><strong>Defensive backs (DB):</strong> the pass defenders. <strong>Cornerbacks (CB)</strong> cover the outside receivers; <strong>safeties (S)</strong> play deep as the last line; a <strong>nickelback (NB)</strong> is a fifth DB who covers the slot receiver.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>The matching game:</strong> the defense can't know the play, but it can see the offense's personnel. So it swaps players to match:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Base (4 DBs):</strong> against heavy groupings like 12 or 21. More linebackers to stop the run.</li>\n<li><strong>Nickel (5 DBs):</strong> against 11 personnel. One linebacker comes off, a nickelback comes on, because a linebacker is usually too slow to cover a slot receiver. (Five DBs, like the five cents in a nickel.)</li>\n<li><strong>Dime (6 DBs):</strong> on obvious passing downs like 3rd and 9. Two linebackers off, two DBs on.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"diagram\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 250\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Base defense with four linemen, three linebackers, two cornerbacks and two safeties against 21 personnel\"><defs><marker id=\"m3w\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/></marker><marker id=\"m3y\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/></marker></defs><line x1=\"0\" x2=\"400\" y1=\"150\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"46\" y=\"145\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.75)\">line of scrimmage</text><circle cx=\"163\" cy=\"134\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"163\" y=\"137.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">DL</text><circle cx=\"191\" cy=\"134\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"191\" y=\"137.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">DL</text><circle cx=\"219\" cy=\"134\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"219\" y=\"137.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">DL</text><circle cx=\"247\" cy=\"134\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"247\" y=\"137.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">DL</text><circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"100\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"103.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">LB</text><circle cx=\"205\" cy=\"96\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"205\" y=\"99.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">LB</text><circle cx=\"260\" cy=\"100\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"260\" y=\"103.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">LB</text><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"124\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"127.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">CB</text><circle cx=\"372\" cy=\"124\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"372\" y=\"127.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">CB</text><circle cx=\"130\" cy=\"44\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"47.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">S</text><circle cx=\"276\" cy=\"44\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"276\" y=\"47.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">S</text><rect x=\"140.0\" y=\"154.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"166.0\" y=\"154.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"192.0\" y=\"154.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"218.0\" y=\"154.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"244.0\" y=\"154.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><circle cx=\"286\" cy=\"166\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"286\" y=\"169.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">TE</text><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"164\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"167.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"372\" cy=\"164\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"372\" y=\"167.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"202\" cy=\"186\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"202\" y=\"189.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">QB</text><circle cx=\"202\" cy=\"212\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"202\" y=\"215.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">FB</text><circle cx=\"202\" cy=\"238\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"202\" y=\"241.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">RB</text><text x=\"205\" y=\"76\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#F2B705\">3 linebackers</text><text x=\"203\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#F2B705\">2 safeties</text></svg></div><p class=\"note\"><strong>Base</strong> (4 DL, 3 LB, 4 DBs) against 21 personnel. Three linebackers to meet a fullback and running back.</p><div class=\"diagram\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 222\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Nickel defense against 11 personnel: four linemen, two linebackers, two cornerbacks, a nickelback over the slot receiver, two deep safeties\"><defs><marker id=\"m4w\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/></marker><marker id=\"m4y\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/></marker></defs><line x1=\"0\" x2=\"400\" y1=\"150\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"46\" y=\"145\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.75)\">line of scrimmage</text><circle cx=\"163\" cy=\"132\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"163\" y=\"135.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">DL</text><circle cx=\"191\" cy=\"132\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"191\" y=\"135.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">DL</text><circle cx=\"219\" cy=\"132\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"219\" y=\"135.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\