B, 5 DBs) against 11 personnel. Each receiver has a DB across from him.</p><div class=\"diagram\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 226\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Dime defense with four linemen, one linebacker and six defensive backs on a passing down\"><defs><marker id=\"m5w\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/></marker><marker id=\"m5y\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/></marker></defs><line x1=\"0\" x2=\"400\" y1=\"150\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"46\" y=\"145\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.75)\">line of scrimmage</text><circle cx=\"163\" cy=\"134\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"163\" y=\"137.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">DL</text><circle cx=\"191\" cy=\"134\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"191\" y=\"137.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">DL</text><circle cx=\"219\" cy=\"134\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"219\" y=\"137.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">DL</text><circle cx=\"247\" cy=\"134\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"247\" y=\"137.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">DL</text><circle cx=\"205\" cy=\"96\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"205\" y=\"99.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">LB</text><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"124\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"127.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">CB</text><circle cx=\"372\" cy=\"124\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"372\" y=\"127.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">CB</text><circle cx=\"96\" cy=\"114\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"96\" y=\"117.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">NB</text><circle cx=\"310\" cy=\"110\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"310\" y=\"113.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">DB</text><circle cx=\"130\" cy=\"44\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"47.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">S</text><circle cx=\"276\" cy=\"44\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"276\" y=\"47.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">S</text><rect x=\"140.0\" y=\"154.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"166.0\" y=\"154.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"192.0\" y=\"154.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"218.0\" y=\"154.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"244.0\" y=\"154.0\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><circle cx=\"286\" cy=\"166\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"286\" y=\"169.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">TE</text><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"164\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"167.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"96\" cy=\"170\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"96\" y=\"173.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"372\" cy=\"164\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"372\" y=\"167.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"202\" cy=\"212\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"202\" y=\"215.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">QB</text><circle cx=\"234\" cy=\"212\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"234\" y=\"215.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">RB</text><text x=\"205\" y=\"76\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#F2B705\">only 1 linebacker</text><text x=\"310\" y=\"92\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#F2B705\">6th DB (\"dime back\")</text></svg></div><p class=\"note\"><strong>Dime</strong> (4 DL, 1 LB, 6 DBs) on 3rd and long. DB = the extra defensive back.</p>\n<p><strong>The tradeoff:</strong> every DB added makes the defense faster against passes but smaller against runs. That's the chess match: an offense puts three receivers on the field to pull the defense into nickel, then runs the ball at the lighter group.</p>\n<p><strong>How to spot it on TV:</strong> count the players standing a few yards behind the defensive line. Three = base. Two = nickel. One (or none) = dime.</p>\n<p class=\"note\">Next: from huddle to whistle, how one play actually works.</p>",
